## Start of every session
1. Read `HOUSE_DIR/spec.yaml`, `HOUSE_DIR/DECISIONS.md`, open entries in `HOUSE_DIR/QUESTIONS.md`,
   `HOUSE_DIR/tools.json`.
2. Read `HOUSE_DIR/playbooks/lifecycle.md` and the playbook for `spec.kind` (`build.md` / `optimize.md`).
3. If the human just arrived or says "jak tam": follow `HOUSE_DIR/protocols/briefing.md` first.

